   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>Rewrite the perfect-square expression <span data-math=\"(h+ \\frac {1}{3})^2\">(h+ \\frac {1}{3})^2</span> in standard form <span data-math=\"ax^2+bx+c\">ax^2+bx+c</span>.</li>\n</ol>",
